# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — clthreads 2.4.2 OHOS Makefile 共享库打包链障碍 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-08
# Software: clthreads 2.4.2
# Gate: PR !8958 / 真机 3 轮 conan create 迭代
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
